420
00:38:32.225 --> 00:38:33.781
<i>Marine One out of flares.</i>

421
00:38:33.863 --> 00:38:35.461
<i>Marine Two out of flares.</i>

422
00:38:36.021 --> 00:38:38.055
<i>Marine Two,
