Yeah.

432
00:40:00.017 --> 00:40:01.812
Lynne. Lynne!

433
00:40:03.014 --> 00:40:04.162
No.

434
00:40:06.330 --> 00:40:08.001
My God.
Oh, my God.

435
00:40:10.686 --> 00:40:11.754
Lynne?

436
00:40:13.283 --> 00:40:14.317
Help me stop
the bleeding.

437
00:40:14.402 --> 00:40:15.401
Ben. Ben.

438
00:40:16.200 --> 00:40:19.792
Ben. Get out of the chopper.
Ben, get out of the chopper.

439
00:40:20.356 --> 00:40:22.788
This thing could
blow at any second. Go.

440
00:40:27.949 --> 00:40:29.505
Hey. Hey.

441
00:40:31.305 --> 00:40:33.453
I never thought
