1019
01:30:51.402 --> 01:30:54.994
<i>and to our friends
around the world.</i>

1020
01:30:55.079 --> 01:30:58.068
<i>Far too many people died
for no good reason.</i>

1021
01:30:59.874 --> 01:31:03.545
<i>There are those who will say that
this would never have happened</i>

1022
01:31:03.670 --> 01:31:06.943
<i>if we would just
mind our own business.</i>

1023
01:31:07.067 --> 01:31:09.658
<i>Nothing could be
farther from the truth.</i>

1024
01:31:09.864 --> 01:31:14.092
<i>Frankly, we live in a dangerous
world and we have few good options.</i>

1025
01:31:14.219 --> 01:31:18.254
<i>But the worst option
is to do nothing.</i>

1026
01:31:18.335 --> 01:31:19.926
<i>And finally,</i>

1027
01:31:20.173 --> 01:31:23.128
<i>we owe it to our children
and to their children</i>

1028
01:31:23.210 --> 01:31:25.199
<i>to engage in the world.</i>

1029
01:31:26.567 --> 01:31:28.157
<i>God bless you all</i>

1030
01:31:29.005 --> 01:31:32.516
<i>and God bless
the United States of America.</i>

1031
01:31:32.601 --> 01:31:35.556
<i>That was Vice President Trumbull
live from the White House.</i>
